WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.709 --> 00:00:14.291
Our civilization climbs from the ashes.

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:19.834
The coming generations will have something to build upon.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.583
But it isn’t just knowledge we’d be saving...

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.625
but humanity’s story.

00:00:28.166 --> 00:00:30.375
Our story.

00:00:32.001 --> 00:00:35.041
I know what it feels like to be left alone.

00:00:35.709 --> 00:00:37.667
I will not abandon that boy.

00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:39.250
I think that’s what it’s all about.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.166
Being brave. Embracing change.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.834
Where we went today, was it real?

00:00:52.917 --> 00:00:54.667
Or was it my imagination?

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.458
I love you.

00:00:58.542 --> 00:00:59.834
My family is the reason…

00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:01.125
I’m the way I am.

00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:03.667
Why is it such a big secret?

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.625
We make the move. Make the move.

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:06.583
And we start again.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:09.083
I have this noise in my head.

00:01:09.208 --> 00:01:10.125
It’ll stop.

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.041
One day it’ll go quiet.

00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:16.625
You are the bassline.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:18.208
Without you there’s no song.

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:27.709
At last the night has ended…

00:01:27.792 --> 00:01:29.875
And so, a new day dawns!

00:01:38.917 --> 00:01:40.125
I'm doing good huh?

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:41.709
Real good.

